 "description": "The HICOS PKI smart card module is a single chip implementation of a cryptographic module. The HICOS PKI smart card module is mounted in an ID-1 class smart card body that adheres to ISO/IEC specifications for Integrated Circuit Chip (ICC) based identification cards. The HICOS PKI Smart Card cryptographic module contains an implementation of the Open Platform (OP) Version 2.0.1 specification defining a secure infrastructure for post-issuance programmable smart card chips.",
